   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-reliab-opus\n\nRe-checked on `dev-swift` @ 19a74ffa: the problem still holds. `TopicReaderView.swift:157-158` passes `composer: linked.model.isPrivateConversation ? nil : composer` with the stale comment. `MessagesRootView.swift:45-58` (LOT-128) gives the Messages reader its composer.\n\nOverlap: #1239 and #1209 edit `TopicReaderView.swift`, but in other hunks (around lines 9, 126 and 298). No other open PR touches these lines.\n\nPlan:\n- Move the choice into a pure static (`TopicReaderView.linkedComposer(_:)` or similar, like `ReaderSearchFlow.isOffered`). Test first: a linked private conversation gets the composer. This test is red today.\n- Pass the composer unconditionally and delete the stale comment.\n- Check that the reply/quote/edit/delete paths of a linked MP reader take the same `cat=prive` route as the Messages reader. Legacy and fixtures only; nothing guessed.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, then a Fable review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
